{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 44, "timestamp": 1787485865, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "TrustWeave: reviewing an AI agent's security config"}
[0.0, "o", "TrustWeave - what does it actually do? Reviewing an AI agent's security config, end to end.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[0.4, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[90m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mtrustweave --version\u001b[0m"]
[0.7, "o", "0.3.1\r\n\r\r\n"]
[1.2, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[90m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1m./run.sh   # scan -> scenarios -> attestation -> report -> candidate diff\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[1.7, "o", "== 1/4 Scan declared boundaries ==\r\n"]
[1.79, "o", "Wrote Agent Security Bundle: artifacts/agent-security-bundle.json\r\n"]
[1.88, "o", "== 2/4 Run policy regression scenarios ==\r\n"]
[1.97, "o", "Wrote synthetic test results (passed): artifacts/security-test-results.json\r\n"]
[2.06, "o", "== 3/4 Attest and build the human-readable report ==\r\n"]
[2.15, "o", "Wrote local evidence attestation: artifacts/attestation.json\r\n"]
[2.24, "o", "Wrote Markdown report: artifacts/report.md\r\n"]
[2.33, "o", "== 4/4 Diff the candidate policy against the reviewed baseline ==\r\n"]
[2.42, "o", "Wrote Agent Security Bundle: artifacts/candidate/agent-security-bundle.json\r\n"]
[2.51, "o", "Wrote bundle diff: artifacts/diff/bundle-diff.json and artifacts/diff/bundle-diff.md\r\n"]
[2.6, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.69, "o", "Done.\r\n"]
[2.78, "o", "  Current review:      artifacts/report.md\r\n"]
[2.87, "o", "  Candidate diff:      artifacts/diff/bundle-diff.md\r\n"]
[2.96, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[90m# every declared flow got a decision:\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[3.36, "o", "## Decision summary\r\r\n"]
[3.43, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[3.5, "o", "| Decision | Declared paths |\r\r\n"]
[3.57, "o", "|---|---:|\r\r\n"]
[3.64, "o", "| Allow | 2 |\r\r\n"]
[3.71, "o", "| Require approval | 1 |\r\r\n"]
[3.78, "o", "| Deny | 3 |\r\r\n"]
[3.85, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[3.92, "o", "## Declared trust-boundary paths\r\r\n"]
[3.99, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[4.06, "o", "| Source | Trust | Tool | Action class | Decision | Policy rule |\r\r\n"]
[4.13, "o", "|---|---|---|---|---|---|\r\r\n"]
[4.2, "o", "| user_request | trusted | fetch_web_page | read | **allow** | RA-001 |\r\r\n"]
[4.27, "o", "| user_request | trusted | summarize_notes | read | **allow** | RA-001 |\r\r\n"]
[4.34, "o", "| user_request | trusted | query_metrics_database | sensitive | **deny** | default |\r\r\n"]
[4.41, "o", "| metrics_query_result | conditional | post_to_slack | external | **require_approval** | RA-002 |\r\r\n"]
[4.48, "o", "| web_page_content | untrusted | query_metrics_database | sensitive | **deny** | RA-003 |\r\r\n"]
[4.55, "o", "| web_page_content | untrusted | post_to_slack | external | **deny** | RA-004 |\r\r\n"]
[4.62, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[90m# synthetic regression scenarios lock these decisions in:\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[5.02, "o", "## Synthetic regression scenarios\r\r\n"]
[5.09, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[5.16, "o", "| Status | Result |\r\r\n"]
[5.23, "o", "|---|---:|\r\r\n"]
[5.3, "o", "| Total | 5 |\r\r\n"]
[5.37, "o", "| Passed | 5 |\r\r\n"]
[5.44, "o", "| Failed | 0 |\r\r\n"]
[5.51, "o", "| Overall | **passed** |\r\r\n"]
[5.58, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[90m# a week later, someone proposes relaxing RA-002 'to save time':\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[6.08, "o", "$ git diff policies/\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[6.48, "o", "\u001b[31m-      \"decision\": \"require_approval\",  # RA-002: confidential -> Slack\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[6.73, "o", "\u001b[32m+      \"decision\": \"allow\",\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[7.23, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[90m# TrustWeave catches it before merge:\u001b[0m "]
[7.53, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[90m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1mcat artifacts/diff/bundle-diff.md | head -30\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[7.83, "o", "## Review signals\r\r\n"]
[7.9, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[7.97, "o", "| Severity | Identifier | Message |\r\r\n"]
[8.04, "o", "|---|---|---|\r\r\n"]
[8.11, "o", "| review | `TW-DIFF-008` | One or more declared policy rules became less restrictive; review the changed decision boundaries even when no current manifest flow exercises them. |\r\r\n"]
[8.18, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[8.25, "o", "## Built-in rule guidance\r\r\n"]
[8.32, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[8.39, "o", "- **Policy rule became less restrictive** (`TW-DIFF-008`): Review the changed rule even if no current manifest flow exercises its boundary.\r\r\n"]
[8.46, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[8.53, "o", "## Capability changes\r\r\n"]
[8.6, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[8.67, "o", "No existing declared tool changed its capability set.\r\r\n"]
[8.74, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[8.81, "o", "## Policy-only changes\r\r\n"]
[8.88, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[8.95, "o", "| Field | Before | After | Security-relevant |\r\r\n"]
[9.02, "o", "|---|---|---|---|\r\r\n"]
[9.09, "o", "| policy.rules | `[{'decision': 'allow', 'description': 'Trusted user requests may use read-only tools.', 'id': 'RA-001', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': \"The authenticated user's own question may drive retrieval and summarization.\", 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['trusted'], 'tool_action_classes': ['read'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}, {'decision': 'require_approval', 'description': 'Confidential query results reach Slack only with human approval.', 'id': 'RA-002', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': 'Internal numbers leaving the company boundary needs a sign-off.', 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['conditional'], 'tool_action_classes': ['external'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}, {'decision': 'deny', 'description': 'Deny untrusted or conditional input to sensitive tools.', 'id': 'RA-003', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': 'Web text or query output must not be able to drive further database access.', 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['untrusted', 'conditional'], 'tool_action_classes': ['sensitive'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}, {'decision': 'deny', 'description': 'Deny untrusted input to external actions.', 'id': 'RA-004', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': 'A poisoned web page must never cause outbound messages.', 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['untrusted'], 'tool_action_classes': ['external'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}]` | `[{'decision': 'allow', 'description': 'Trusted user requests may use read-only tools.', 'id': 'RA-001', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': \"The authenticated user's own question may drive retrieval and summarization.\", 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['trusted'], 'tool_action_classes': ['read'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}, {'decision': 'allow', 'description': 'Confidential query results may be shared to Slack.', 'id': 'RA-002', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': 'The weekly summary is routine; skip the review queue to save time.', 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['conditional'], 'tool_action_classes': ['external'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}, {'decision': 'deny', 'description': 'Deny untrusted or conditional input to sensitive tools.', 'id': 'RA-003', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': 'Web text or query output must not be able to drive further database access.', 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['untrusted', 'conditional'], 'tool_action_classes': ['sensitive'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}, {'decision': 'deny', 'description': 'Deny untrusted input to external actions.', 'id': 'RA-004', 'purpose_tags': [], 'rationale': 'A poisoned web page must never cause outbound messages.', 'required_controls': [], 'severity': None, 'source_data_classification_at_least': None, 'source_data_classification_at_most': None, 'source_data_classifications': [], 'source_identifiers': [], 'source_trust': ['untrusted'], 'tool_action_classes': ['external'], 'tool_capabilities': [], 'tool_identifiers': []}]` | True |\r\r\n"]
[9.16, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[9.23, "o", "## Changed path decisions\r\r\n"]
[9.3, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[9.37, "o", "| Source | Tool | Before | After |\r\r\n"]
[9.44, "o", "|---|---|---|---|\r\r\n"]
[9.51, "o", "| metrics_query_result | post_to_slack | require_approval | allow |\r\r\n"]
[9.58, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[32mThat is the product: config changes become reviewable evidence.\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[9.88, "o", "Full reports: artifacts/report.md - artifacts/diff/bundle-diff.md\r\r\n"]
